{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35641","headline":"迁居清谿和刘书记见示 · 李山甫","name":"迁居清谿和刘书记见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"担锡归来竹绕谿，过津曾笑鲁儒迷。\n端居味道尘劳息，扣寂眠云心境齐。\n还似村家无宠禄，时将隣叟话幽栖。\n山衣毳烂唯添野，石井源清不贮泥。\n祖意岂从年腊得，松枝肯爲雪霜低。\n晚天吟望秋光重，雨阵横空蔽断霓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}